Z||000009||L.I. Fieros||12-29-2001||04:41 PM||||Artherd -- Couldn't have said it any better than that. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"><P>Gtsonly -- I would have agreed with you before riding in this car.  However, after riding in the car, I can now say that the characteristics and feel of the two are very similar.  Same front end feel, same planted rear end feel......<P>Oh, and the 911 GT2 is absolutely awesome.  I love that car.  I've been telling everyone that will be the first non-Fiero vehicle I buy.  Someday...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Later,<BR>Dave||||reg||1
