Z||000011||Slammed Fiero||12-29-2001||10:50 PM||||""my favorite porsche its a 929 twin turbo <BR>a friend of mine has a white convertible <BR>""<P>Wow ,&gt; I don't know where to begin to start with this one...<P>IT's a 959 <BR>It's not legal for road Use in the US or Canada (Bill gates has 2 of them and can't get them lisenced) Accordin gto an Article in Exellence (magazine about porsches)<P>they never built a convert 959.<P>JM<BR>Occasional pilot of a 94 911 RS America with Champion motorsport built 3.8 , TWM induction , B&B triflow , Motec "brain" kit , 17" Kinesis wheels , G50 with 60% LSD and 3.70 Gears. 2690lbs ...street/ Track terror. ||||reg||1
Z||000012||rogergarrison||12-30-2001||12:33 AM||||Im with slammed here.The all wheel drive 959 is not legal here except for off road rallying. Wouldnt pass crash test or emmissions. It could be your friend has a body kit on an older 911. And they did manufacture a kitcar body a few years ago for a tube frame/ stretched VW pan.||||reg||1
